# Decoy ownership data. This file is intentionally named `CODEOWNERS.absent`,
# not `CODEOWNERS` or `.github/CODEOWNERS`, so it must never be treated as a
# real ownership file by the assessor -- even though its declared patterns
# below would otherwise fully satisfy the required governance coverage.
src/governance/** @octo-org/governance
policies/** @octo-org/governance
tests/** @octo-org/governance
.github/workflows/governed-actions.yml @octo-org/governance
tests/governed-actions-manifest.json @octo-org/governance
tests/governed-actions-apply-plan.json @octo-org/governance
